; nl-form-metal-token-weave-band.fk — NL becomes Form, Form retrieves a cell,
; a JIT Metal kernel may stand in for a vocab token, and an unhealthy native
; answer escalates then comes home by learning.
;
; Verdict 16383 when every claim lands:
;   1      "the square of 7" translates to mul
;   2      that Form executes to 49
;   4      retrieve names MATH-MUL and the square cell
;   8      "emit matvec kernel" is a kernel-kind token
;   16     JIT MSL is named form_matvec_f32 and deterministic
;   32     a more-vital kernel alternative replaces the default vocab token
;   64     a late alternative is timeout==nothing and keeps the default
;   128    unknown NL is unhealthy and escalates
;   256    the escalation is a remote-oracle crossing
;   512    a disk GGUF load is native-recipe and is not a crossing
;   1024   an ollama HTTP load is a crossing
;   2048   the same NL, after a teacher row, stays native
;   4096   learning will not adopt a non-equivalent star
;   8192   "retrieve cell-card" names form/form-stdlib/cell-card.fk
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/dsv4-token-recipe-swap.fk form-stdlib/nl-form-metal-token-weave.fk

(do (nfw-check))
